/tmp/arxiv2504.b4G0dx/Chapters/1_introduction.tex:51:	\isdts is $W[1]$-hard on DAGs of depth 4, when parameterized by $k$.
/tmp/arxiv2504.b4G0dx/Chapters/1_introduction.tex:55:Additionally, we show that a combination of the parameters $k$ and treewidth leads to tractability in DAGs. We do so by adapting the recently developed framework of galactic reconfiguration \cite{Bartier2023} to directed graphs. The following result can be considered our main contribution.
