The module is built and the first complete gate run is in progress. The potentially expensive parts are the mandated 200,000 structure-aware guesses, eight-seed adversary panel, and relabelling-invariance checks; the reference solver itself is fast but records algebraic operation counts rather than hiding them.
diff --git a/gen_2504_10671.py b/gen_2504_10671.py
